{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30121","headline":"和郑校书夏日游郑泉 · 刘得仁","name":"和郑校书夏日游郑泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太虚悬畏景，古木蔽清阴。\n爰有泉堪挹，闲思日可寻。\n来闻鸣滴滴，照竦碧沈沈。\n几脉成溪壑，何人测浅深。\n澄时无一物，分处厉千林。\n净溉灵根药，凉浮玉翅禽。\n饮疑蠲宿疾，见自失烦襟。\n僧共云前濑，龙和月下吟。\n叠光轻吹动，彻底晓霞侵。\n不用频游去，令君少进心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}